Comment: 0,0:00:08.10,0:00:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好屌
Comment: 0,0:00:09.38,0:00:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就像是和自己的身體融為一體
Comment: 0,0:00:11.33,0:00:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就像是在揮動著自己的手腳一樣
Comment: 0,0:00:13.54,0:00:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,逐漸支配所有空間的感覺
Comment: 0,0:00:17.82,0:00:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,看來跟強者對戰是提升等級的捷徑
Comment: 0,0:00:21.45,0:00:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這句話還真沒說錯啊
Comment: 0,0:00:23.53,0:00:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,對吧 下三濫
Comment: 0,0:00:25.58,0:00:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我會心存感激地
Comment: 0,0:00:27.03,0:00:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,把你打得屍骨無存
Comment: 0,0:00:33.71,0:00:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,發生什麼事了?
Comment: 0,0:00:35.53,0:00:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,電漿正在擴散
Comment: 0,0:00:38.22,0:00:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這風到底是怎麼回事
Comment: 0,0:00:40.70,0:00:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,風力操縱嗎?
Comment: 0,0:00:42.49,0:00:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不對
Comment: 0,0:00:44.26,0:00:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,風車在逆向旋轉著?
Comment: 0,0:00:46.81,0:00:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,等等!
Comment: 0,0:00:47.79,0:00:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我有聽說過
Comment: 0,0:00:49.59,0:00:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,發電機的馬達
Comment: 0,0:00:51.39,0:00:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,只要接收到特定電磁波的影響就會運轉
Comment: 0,0:00:54.91,0:00:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是她們啊!
Comment: 0,0:00:56.36,0:00:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,可惡
Comment: 0,0:00:57.32,0:00:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但這到底是怎麼回事
Comment: 0,0:00:59.11,0:01:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那些風車
Comment: 0,0:01:00.41,0:01:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,並不是在胡亂轉動
Comment: 0,0:01:02.69,0:01:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,而是被統率著刻意擾亂我的計算式
Comment: 0,0:01:08.37,0:01:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,她看到的畫面
Comment: 0,0:01:10.22,0:01:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,透過網路...
Comment: 0,0:01:19.26,0:01:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,幹掉妳!!
Comment: 0,0:01:22.76,0:01:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不會讓你得逞
Comment: 0,0:01:31.98,0:01:35.24,Default,OP,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:03:01.95,0:03:05.53,Default,001,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:03:33.85,0:03:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真是難以理解啊
Comment: 0,0:03:36.30,0:03:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,倒在那邊的下三濫
Comment: 0,0:03:39.01,0:03:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,還有妳
Comment: 0,0:03:40.37,0:03:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,幹嘛要庇護人偶?
Comment: 0,0:03:42.91,0:03:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那些傢伙是妳的劣質複製品
Comment: 0,0:03:46.23,0:03:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,世界上最看她們不爽的人
Comment: 0,0:03:49.59,0:03:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,應該是妳才對吧
Comment: 0,0:03:51.96,0:03:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,看到這些跟妳長得一樣的東西被打壞  讓妳感到不爽嗎?
Comment: 0,0:03:56.32,0:03:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,只是
Comment: 0,0:03:57.49,0:03:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這種理由不至於讓妳拚上性命吧
Comment: 0,0:04:03.06,0:04:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,還是說無法容忍自己以外的絕對能力者搶先誕生嗎?
Comment: 0,0:04:03.06,0:04:07.18,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(1142,980)}Level 6
Comment: 0,0:04:07.83,0:04:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,又或者是
Comment: 0,0:04:09.50,0:04:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,為這個埋下實驗起因的自己
Comment: 0,0:04:12.81,0:04:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,來贖罪的嗎?
Comment: 0,0:04:17.59,0:04:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我對什麼「神之頭腦」沒有興趣
Comment: 0,0:04:21.35,0:04:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,也不認為做這種事就能贖罪
Comment: 0,0:04:27.51,0:04:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,因為她們是妹妹
Comment: 0,0:04:31.04,0:04:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,她們
Comment: 0,0:04:32.86,0:04:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是我的妹妹
Comment: 0,0:04:36.31,0:04:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,僅此而已
Comment: 0,0:04:40.31,0:04:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,對不起
Comment: 0,0:04:41.59,0:04:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,事到如今 我也知道我沒資格這樣說
Comment: 0,0:04:44.79,0:04:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是
Comment: 0,0:04:47.95,0:04:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,至少現在容許我...
Comment: 0,0:04:49.20,0:04:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,站在這裡好嗎?
Comment: 0,0:04:55.50,0:04:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好...
Comment: 0,0:05:01.31,0:05:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我絕對不會再讓任何一個人死掉
Comment: 0,0:05:09.91,0:05:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,什麼嘛
Comment: 0,0:05:12.13,0:05:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我還想說妳會講出什麼狗屁來
Comment: 0,0:05:14.61,0:05:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,玩姐妹家家酒啊
Comment: 0,0:05:16.23,0:05:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,無聊到爆
Comment: 0,0:05:18.13,0:05:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不會再讓任何一個人被殺掉?
Comment: 0,0:05:20.35,0:05:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不要太得意忘形了 妳這個廢渣
Comment: 0,0:05:23.30,0:05:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就憑妳連阻擋我都做不到
Comment: 0,0:05:26.43,0:05:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就跟視力檢查最多只能量到2.0一樣
Comment: 0,0:05:30.86,0:05:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,還不是因為學園都市
Comment: 0,0:05:32.15,0:05:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,最多只到等級5而已
Comment: 0,0:05:35.10,0:05:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我才只好屈於此位
Comment: 0,0:05:40.13,0:05:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,既然這麼麻煩 乾脆就一起把妳們幹掉...
Comment: 0,0:06:11.41,0:06:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,怎麼可能...
Comment: 0,0:06:13.35,0:06:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你以為...
Comment: 0,0:06:14.71,0:06:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我到目前為止殺過多少人啊?
Comment: 0,0:06:18.64,0:06:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,怎麼做可以破壞掉人體
Comment: 0,0:06:21.37,0:06:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我最清楚不過了
