Comment: 0,0:06:25.47,0:06:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,怎麼可能...
Comment: 0,0:06:26.70,0:06:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,還站得起來!?
Comment: 0,0:06:35.27,0:06:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我在怕什麼!?
Comment: 0,0:06:43.84,0:06:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不就是還沒死成嘛
Comment: 0,0:06:46.61,0:06:48.29,Default,???,0,0,0,karaoke,就算風被封鎖了
