Comment: 0,0:06:53.75,0:06:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你還真有趣啊
Comment: 0,0:06:57.18,0:06:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這真的是...
Comment: 0,0:06:59.79,0:07:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,太有意思啦!!
Comment: 0,0:07:22.52,0:07:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,給我咬緊牙關吧
