Comment: 0,0:07:29.59,0:07:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,稍微發點威吧
Comment: 0,0:07:33.14,0:07:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,怎麼會...
Comment: 0,0:07:35.23,0:07:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,怎麼會打不死他?
Comment: 0,0:07:38.52,0:07:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,他想保護...人偶們?
Comment: 0,0:07:41.99,0:07:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,還差一步...
Comment: 0,0:07:43.91,0:07:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這份絕對的力量
Comment: 0,0:07:46.26,0:07:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,為什麼...
Comment: 0,0:07:48.49,0:07:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我會...
Comment: 0,0:08:01.73,0:08:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這份力量 也許有一天...
Comment: 0,0:08:04.10,0:08:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,會和世界為敵
Comment: 0,0:08:07.80,0:08:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,也有可能會毀滅一切
Comment: 0,0:08:14.38,0:08:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,可是
Comment: 0,0:08:16.94,0:08:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,只要你進化到「最強」
Comment: 0,0:08:19.92,0:08:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,也許會有所改變
Comment: 0,0:08:22.18,0:08:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,為此
Comment: 0,0:08:24.02,0:08:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,要按照計畫進行實驗
Comment: 0,0:08:29.27,0:08:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,天竺鼠
Comment: 0,0:08:30.94,0:08:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,人偶
Comment: 0,0:08:32.54,0:08:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,複製人
Comment: 0,0:08:35.50,0:08:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果力量會引起紛爭
Comment: 0,0:08:38.45,0:08:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,只要成為讓人連對戰的念頭都不敢起的絕對存在就好了
Comment: 0,0:08:44.14,0:08:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣的話...
Comment: 0,0:08:47.65,0:08:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,總有一天 再也...
Comment: 0,0:08:50.74,0:08:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣的話
Comment: 0,0:08:52.78,0:08:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就再也...
Comment: 0,0:09:03.41,0:09:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就再也...
Comment: 0,0:09:04.78,0:09:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不會傷害任何人...
Comment: 0,0:09:10.70,0:09:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妹妹們可是...
Comment: 0,0:09:10.70,0:09:11.94,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(870,980)}Sisters
Comment: 0,0:09:12.42,0:09:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,用盡全力地...
Comment: 0,0:09:14.36,0:09:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這些孩子們 是我的...
Comment: 0,0:09:21.04,0:09:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真是的...
Comment: 0,0:09:29.25,0:09:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我到底在幹嘛...
Comment: 0,0:09:51.32,0:09:53.32,Default,break,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:09:55.93,0:10:00.91,Default,002,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:10:14.63,0:10:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,什麼?
Comment: 0,0:10:18.48,0:10:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳怎麼...
Comment: 0,0:10:38.61,0:10:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,打擾囉...
Comment: 0,0:10:41.05,0:10:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,在睡覺啊
Comment: 0,0:10:49.33,0:10:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,還真的打倒了學園都市的第一位
Comment: 0,0:10:56.24,0:10:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你還真是亂來啊...
Comment: 0,0:11:06.05,0:11:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,對不起
Comment: 0,0:11:06.90,0:11:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,吵到你了嗎?
Comment: 0,0:11:09.74,0:11:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這是探病的餅乾
Comment: 0,0:11:12.29,0:11:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我從百貨地下街挑了比較貴的
Comment: 0,0:11:14.71,0:11:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,應該不錯吃啦
Comment: 0,0:11:18.44,0:11:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,還有啊
Comment: 0,0:11:19.96,0:11:22.27,Default,???,0,0,0,karaoke,覺得還是得和你說聲...
Comment: 0,0:11:22.71,0:11:23.55,Default,???,0,0,0,karaoke,那個...
Comment: 0,0:11:23.94,0:11:24.95,Default,???,0,0,0,karaoke,很感謝...
Comment: 0,0:11:24.43,0:11:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,說到餅乾的話
Comment: 0,0:11:26.90,0:11:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,還是親手做的最好吧
Comment: 0,0:11:32.49,0:11:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你啊 到底期待我是什麼樣的角色啊?
Comment: 0,0:11:35.81,0:11:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒有啦
Comment: 0,0:11:36.84,0:11:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,笨拙的人笨拙地費盡心思做出慘不忍睹的餅乾才棒
Comment: 0,0:11:42.29,0:11:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳不懂嗎?
Comment: 0,0:11:46.04,0:11:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,所以說 你到底是在期待些什麼啊!?
Comment: 0,0:11:48.97,0:11:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,等...等等啦
Comment: 0,0:11:49.89,0:11:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這裡是醫院
Comment: 0,0:11:50.61,0:11:51.49,Default,???,0,0,0,karaoke,我是傷患啊
Comment: 0,0:11:51.50,0:11:52.28,Default,???,0,0,0,karaoke,啊 笨蛋
Comment: 0,0:11:52.29,0:11:53.92,Default,???,0,0,0,karaoke,這裡有很多精密儀器啊
Comment: 0,0:11:58.99,0:11:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真是的
Comment: 0,0:12:04.40,0:12:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,昨天晚上
Comment: 0,0:12:06.22,0:12:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂妹有來過喔
Comment: 0,0:12:09.08,0:12:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,她說
Comment: 0,0:12:10.61,0:12:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,實驗已經中止了
Comment: 0,0:12:15.47,0:12:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,可是
Comment: 0,0:12:17.12,0:12:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,都是因為我
Comment: 0,0:12:18.71,0:12:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,讓很多人...
Comment: 0,0:12:26.03,0:12:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果妳沒有提供DNA圖譜的話
Comment: 0,0:12:29.29,0:12:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妹妹們也不會出生在這個世界上
Comment: 0,0:12:29.29,0:12:31.57,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(624,980)}Sisters
Comment: 0,0:12:32.93,0:12:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,雖然那個實驗也有很多不對的地方
Comment: 0,0:12:36.36,0:12:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但就妹妹們的出生這件事來看
Comment: 0,0:12:36.36,0:12:38.14,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(777,980)}Sisters
Comment: 0,0:12:39.34,0:12:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我覺得
Comment: 0,0:12:40.77,0:12:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是值得妳驕傲的
Comment: 0,0:12:45.12,0:12:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果她們沒出生的話
Comment: 0,0:12:47.06,0:12:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就無法感受快樂
Comment: 0,0:12:48.80,0:12:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,也無法體會悲傷了
Comment: 0,0:12:54.01,0:12:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,而且她們一定
Comment: 0,0:12:56.97,0:13:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,也不想看到妳一個人愁眉苦臉的樣子
Comment: 0,0:13:09.42,0:13:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳的傷勢還好嗎?
Comment: 0,0:13:08.81,0:13:09.88,Upside,,0,0,0,karaoke,要玩什麼呢
Comment: 0,0:13:09.92,0:13:11.27,Upside,???,0,0,0,karaoke,盪鞦韆~~
Comment: 0,0:13:11.72,0:13:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,和那個少年比起來的話
Comment: 0,0:13:13.46,0:13:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,根本沒什麼
Comment: 0,0:13:15.76,0:13:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,太好了
Comment: 0,0:13:17.15,0:13:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,要推囉
Comment: 0,0:13:18.92,0:13:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,來
Comment: 0,0:13:23.20,0:13:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,由機械所創造的生命
Comment: 0,0:13:28.76,0:13:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,剛出生的她們
Comment: 0,0:13:30.97,0:13:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是一張白紙
Comment: 0,0:13:33.01,0:13:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,所以
Comment: 0,0:13:33.97,0:13:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,只要灌輸她們自己是「實驗動物」的話
Comment: 0,0:13:37.62,0:13:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,她們就會欣然接受這是自己存在的價值
Comment: 0,0:13:43.21,0:13:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是
Comment: 0,0:13:44.30,0:13:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果像他一樣
Comment: 0,0:13:45.51,0:13:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,周遭的人也將她們當做是人來看待
Comment: 0,0:13:49.09,0:13:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這些孩子們
Comment: 0,0:13:50.35,0:13:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,一定也...
Comment: 0,0:13:53.92,0:13:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那個啊...
Comment: 0,0:13:56.91,0:13:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,也許妳根本不想看到我
Comment: 0,0:13:59.76,0:14:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,也不肯原諒我
Comment: 0,0:14:02.15,0:14:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,今後 妳們要得到世界的接納
Comment: 0,0:14:04.75,0:14:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,也許還會有許多障礙
Comment: 0,0:14:07.57,0:14:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,所以...
Comment: 0,0:14:08.73,0:14:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這個...
Comment: 0,0:14:11.47,0:14:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果有什麼我可以幫忙...
Comment: 0,0:14:14.05,0:14:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,...的話
Comment: 0,0:14:17.31,0:14:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這就是站立盪鞦韆
Comment: 0,0:14:19.17,0:14:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂實踐從學習裝置得到的知識與風融為一體
Comment: 0,0:14:19.17,0:14:24.20,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(778,980)}Testament
Comment: 0,0:14:24.37,0:14:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,哇~~好厲害
Comment: 0,0:14:31.71,0:14:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,再這樣下去可能會影響到傷勢
Comment: 0,0:14:34.50,0:14:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,先告一段落了
Comment: 0,0:14:36.27,0:14:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂擦著汗
Comment: 0,0:14:38.99,0:14:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,哎呀
Comment: 0,0:14:39.90,0:14:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,怎麼了嗎?
Comment: 0,0:14:42.18,0:14:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,抱歉 先不要理我
Comment: 0,0:14:44.15,0:14:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,姐姐
Comment: 0,0:14:45.20,0:14:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,再幫我推
Comment: 0,0:14:46.33,0:14:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,欸~我才不要
Comment: 0,0:14:48.96,0:14:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣不可以唷
Comment: 0,0:14:51.16,0:14:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,身為姐姐
Comment: 0,0:14:52.49,0:14:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,有義務聽從妹妹的任性
Comment: 0,0:14:56.29,0:15:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂趁幼苗時期加以洗腦
Comment: 0,0:15:00.15,0:15:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,喂!!
Comment: 0,0:15:08.09,0:15:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這個叫做小貓唷
Comment: 0,0:15:10.51,0:15:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我知道!
Comment: 0,0:15:12.53,0:15:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,大姐姐 妳們是姐妹嗎?
Comment: 0,0:15:14.83,0:15:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,長得一模一樣!
Comment: 0,0:15:16.88,0:15:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳們是雙胞胎吧
Comment: 0,0:15:18.89,0:15:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,哪一個是姐姐? 哪一個是妹妹?
Comment: 0,0:15:22.52,0:15:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這個的話...
Comment: 0,0:15:24.19,0:15:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,等一下 琉璃想猜猜看
Comment: 0,0:15:26.29,0:15:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我想想喔
Comment: 0,0:15:28.12,0:15:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我想想...
Comment: 0,0:15:33.05,0:15:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,明明是自己要猜的...
Comment: 0,0:15:36.05,0:15:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這個
Comment: 0,0:15:37.34,0:15:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這個大姐姐是妹妹對吧
Comment: 0,0:15:39.65,0:15:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,因為她有呱太
Comment: 0,0:15:41.73,0:15:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,琉璃也有布偶喔!
Comment: 0,0:15:46.06,0:15:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂做出噴飯的動作
Comment: 0,0:15:50.23,0:15:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,的確她是有與年齡不符的幼稚喜好
Comment: 0,0:15:54.56,0:15:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,又粗魯
Comment: 0,0:15:55.53,0:15:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,又急性子
Comment: 0,0:15:56.44,0:15:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,又愛吵架
Comment: 0,0:15:58.68,0:16:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不只這樣 還不敢承認自己喜歡什麼
Comment: 0,0:16:01.57,0:16:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,非常彆扭
Comment: 0,0:16:04.68,0:16:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,卻是個會為了御坂而拼上性命
Comment: 0,0:16:07.74,0:16:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,讓人頭痛的姐姐
Comment: 0,0:16:24.79,0:16:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真是不可思議
Comment: 0,0:16:26.53,0:16:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,本來御坂應該是要在昨天晚上的實驗死掉的
Comment: 0,0:16:30.93,0:16:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這個是已經重複一萬次以上
Comment: 0,0:16:34.43,0:16:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,理所當然的事情
Comment: 0,0:16:36.61,0:16:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,可是
Comment: 0,0:16:38.32,0:16:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,在這個瞬間
Comment: 0,0:16:40.46,0:16:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,卻仍然繼續在活動
Comment: 0,0:16:43.85,0:16:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂們
Comment: 0,0:16:45.24,0:16:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是為了被殺掉才製造出來的
Comment: 0,0:16:48.99,0:16:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這是唯一的存在意義
Comment: 0,0:16:51.65,0:16:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,也是出生的理由
Comment: 0,0:16:54.90,0:16:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,可是
Comment: 0,0:16:56.11,0:16:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,因為姐姐與那名少年
Comment: 0,0:16:58.36,0:16:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,失去了這個存在的目的
Comment: 0,0:17:01.62,0:17:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,被裁員了
Comment: 0,0:17:03.49,0:17:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒工作
Comment: 0,0:17:04.90,0:17:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,流離失所中
Comment: 0,0:17:09.84,0:17:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,所以
Comment: 0,0:17:12.05,0:17:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,為了讓御坂也能找到活著的意義
Comment: 0,0:17:16.18,0:17:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,今後也請陪著御坂一起去尋找
Comment: 0,0:17:20.83,0:17:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂竭盡全力任性地說著
Comment: 0,0:17:28.69,0:17:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,請多指教
Comment: 0,0:17:38.33,0:17:39.45,Upside,,0,0,0,karaoke,姐姐 再一次
Comment: 0,0:17:39.81,0:17:40.37,Upside,,0,0,0,karaoke,不夠~
Comment: 0,0:17:40.89,0:17:41.17,Upside,,0,0,0,karaoke,耶~
Comment: 0,0:17:47.25,0:17:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,原來如此
Comment: 0,0:17:48.86,0:17:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是這麼回事啊
Comment: 0,0:17:50.86,0:17:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒錯沒錯
Comment: 0,0:17:52.13,0:17:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂啊...
Comment: 0,0:17:55.24,0:17:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,說是在宿舍的廚房
Comment: 0,0:17:56.61,0:17:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,會引來眾多視線很麻煩
Comment: 0,0:17:58.74,0:18:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就跑來借我家的烤箱
Comment: 0,0:18:00.93,0:18:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真是大混亂啊
Comment: 0,0:18:02.92,0:18:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,所以才這麼...
Comment: 0,0:18:05.83,0:18:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真是讓人感到意外啊
Comment: 0,0:18:07.36,0:18:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,對吧
Comment: 0,0:18:08.61,0:18:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不過
Comment: 0,0:18:09.73,0:18:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂似乎恢復了精神  太好了
Comment: 0,0:18:12.53,0:18:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就是啊
Comment: 0,0:18:13.73,0:18:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不過 到底是要做給誰當禮物呢?
Comment: 0,0:18:16.88,0:18:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不管我怎麼問她都不告訴我啊
Comment: 0,0:18:24.40,0:18:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真是的
Comment: 0,0:18:25.89,0:18:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,佐天就只知道拿我開玩笑
Comment: 0,0:18:28.81,0:18:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,又不是因為我喜歡他才做的
Comment: 0,0:18:31.97,0:18:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,只是謝禮啦 謝禮!
Comment: 0,0:18:35.59,0:18:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是...
Comment: 0,0:18:36.42,0:18:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,反正他肯定會說
Comment: 0,0:18:39.06,0:18:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,「我是為自己而戰 沒做什麼需要被感謝的事情啦」
Comment: 0,0:18:44.04,0:18:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,諸如此類的話吧
Comment: 0,0:18:46.90,0:18:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是我雞婆...
Comment: 0,0:18:47.88,0:18:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,嗎...
Comment: 0,0:18:50.71,0:18:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不不不不
Comment: 0,0:18:52.00,0:18:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不過 照這個邏輯
Comment: 0,0:18:53.34,0:18:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,要遵照常理和他道謝也是我的自由
Comment: 0,0:18:59.11,0:18:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,話說回來
Comment: 0,0:19:00.01,0:19:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,要是敢不收我親手做的餅乾就給我等著瞧...
Comment: 0,0:19:03.03,0:19:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳說什麼東西免費啊?
Comment: 0,0:19:08.32,0:19:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,為什麼你會在這裡!?
Comment: 0,0:19:11.28,0:19:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你應該還在住院吧?
Comment: 0,0:19:13.82,0:19:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒啦
Comment: 0,0:19:14.99,0:19:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,住院費也不便宜
Comment: 0,0:19:17.45,0:19:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,而且家裡有個飢餓的同居人
Comment: 0,0:19:19.41,0:19:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,一天比一天更兇暴啊...
Comment: 0,0:19:22.56,0:19:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,話說
Comment: 0,0:19:23.42,0:19:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳才是 在這裡做什麼啊?
Comment: 0,0:19:28.16,0:19:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我是...
Comment: 0,0:19:29.81,0:19:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,莫非 是要再來探望我嗎?
Comment: 0,0:19:33.83,0:19:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,開玩笑啦
Comment: 0,0:19:35.00,0:19:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,才...才不是咧!
Comment: 0,0:19:36.90,0:19:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,也不用...
Comment: 0,0:19:38.27,0:19:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這麼用力的否定啦...
Comment: 0,0:19:40.16,0:19:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,笨蛋!!
Comment: 0,0:19:42.11,0:19:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,啊...不是...
Comment: 0,0:19:43.75,0:19:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我不是來探病的...
Comment: 0,0:19:46.24,0:19:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那...那個...
Comment: 0,0:19:47.43,0:19:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這次是...
Comment: 0,0:19:49.29,0:19:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,受到了你很多幫助...
Comment: 0,0:19:53.38,0:19:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,所以...
Comment: 0,0:19:54.66,0:19:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那個...
Comment: 0,0:19:57.67,0:19:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,謝...
Comment: 0,0:19:59.21,0:19:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,謝...
Comment: 0,0:20:00.37,0:20:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,謝謝...
Comment: 0,0:20:02.40,0:20:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,謝謝...
Comment: 0,0:20:03.53,0:20:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,螞蟻?
Comment: 0,0:20:08.11,0:20:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你正在進行自由研究啊
Comment: 0,0:20:10.53,0:20:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,暑假也要結束了啊
Comment: 0,0:20:12.36,0:20:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不是啦!
Comment: 0,0:20:13.43,0:20:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,話說你當我是小學生嗎?
Comment: 0,0:20:15.57,0:20:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真抱歉打擾妳了
Comment: 0,0:20:17.22,0:20:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,再見啦 嗶哩嗶哩
Comment: 0,0:20:27.94,0:20:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂美琴
Comment: 0,0:20:29.74,0:20:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是?
Comment: 0,0:20:31.08,0:20:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我的名字
Comment: 0,0:20:33.07,0:20:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不是嗶哩嗶哩 是御坂美琴
Comment: 0,0:20:35.58,0:20:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,每次都這樣
Comment: 0,0:20:37.52,0:20:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好歹給我記住
Comment: 0,0:20:39.74,0:20:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,雖然和你這樣說可能也沒用
Comment: 0,0:20:46.49,0:20:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,再會啦 御坂
Comment: 0,0:21:01.14,0:21:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,糟糕啦
Comment: 0,0:21:02.87,0:21:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,姐姐大...妳怎麼了!?
Comment: 0,0:21:06.37,0:21:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,身體不舒服嗎?
Comment: 0,0:21:07.92,0:21:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,哪裡受傷了嗎?
Comment: 0,0:21:09.20,0:21:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,還是吃了什麼怪東西!?
Comment: 0,0:21:12.53,0:21:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳...妳在說什麼啊
Comment: 0,0:21:14.87,0:21:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,話說 什麼事情糟糕了?
Comment: 0,0:21:16.76,0:21:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那是...
Comment: 0,0:21:18.85,0:21:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,前段時間的擅自外宿被舍監知道了
Comment: 0,0:21:23.42,0:21:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,叫我們要給她一個讓人心服口服的理由...
Comment: 0,0:21:26.73,0:21:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這下糟糕了啊
Comment: 0,0:21:28.26,0:21:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,得想個藉口...
Comment: 0,0:21:30.02,0:21:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,話說 妳特地為了告訴我這件事跑來嗎?
Comment: 0,0:21:33.74,0:21:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,謝謝
Comment: 0,0:21:35.20,0:21:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是 為什麼知道我在這?
Comment: 0,0:21:37.10,0:21:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,心靈相通嘛...
Comment: 0,0:21:39.48,0:21:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,有姐姐大人的地方就有黑子啊
Comment: 0,0:21:42.30,0:21:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,比起這個 真的沒有地方不舒服嗎?
Comment: 0,0:21:45.35,0:21:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,姐姐大人如果發生了什麼事...
Comment: 0,0:21:47.31,0:21:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我黑子沒辦法坐視不管...
Comment: 0,0:21:49.29,0:21:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真是的
Comment: 0,0:21:50.65,0:21:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,再繼續胡說八道
Comment: 0,0:21:51.92,0:21:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我就不管妳了喔
Comment: 0,0:21:55.14,0:21:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,因為姐姐大人妳...
Comment: 0,0:21:57.59,0:22:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,露出了我從未見過的表情嘛...
Comment: 0,0:22:13.43,0:22:22.15,Default,ED,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:23:30.97,0:23:32.22,Default,next,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:23:32.09,0:23:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂恢復精神真是太好了
Comment: 0,0:23:34.45,0:23:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是那個餅乾到底是要給誰的?
Comment: 0,0:23:36.27,0:23:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,裸體...
Comment: 0,0:23:36.92,0:23:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,白井?
Comment: 0,0:23:37.60,0:23:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,在讀書會上 讓身心都赤‧裸‧裸~!!!
Comment: 0,0:23:40.98,0:23:48.98,Default,thanks,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:23:45.97,0:23:47.97,staff,export,0,0,0,,
