Dialogue: 1,0:20:07.88,0:20:12.63,effect background 01,title,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\p1\pos(20,20)\fscx0\t(0,250,2,\fscx147)\alpha&H90&\t(4250,4500,2,\fscx0)}m 0 0 l 0 60 l 102 60 l 102 0XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX
