Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.13,0:20:12.13,explaination 02,content,0,0,0,,{\pos(30,93)}{\an7\fscy0\t(0,250,2,\fscy100)\t(3750,4000,2,\fscy0)}日文的「螞蟻(アリ)」和「謝謝(ありがとう)」\N的前2個字雙關
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.21,0:23:40.98,下一回,next,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(203,713)}讀\N書\N會
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.10,0:00:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好屌
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.38,0:00:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就像是和自己的身體融為一體
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.33,0:00:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就像是在揮動著自己的手腳一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.54,0:00:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}逐漸支配所有空間的感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.82,0:00:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}看來跟強者對戰是提升等級的捷徑
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.45,0:00:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這句話還真沒說錯啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.53,0:00:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}對吧 下三濫
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.58,0:00:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我會心存感激地
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.03,0:00:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}把你打得屍骨無存
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.71,0:00:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}發生什麼事了?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.53,0:00:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}電漿正在擴散
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.22,0:00:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這風到底是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.70,0:00:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}風力操縱嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.49,0:00:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不對
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.26,0:00:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}風車在逆向旋轉著?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.81,0:00:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}等等!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.79,0:00:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我有聽說過
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.59,0:00:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}發電機的馬達
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.39,0:00:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}只要接收到特定電磁波的影響就會運轉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.91,0:00:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是她們啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.36,0:00:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.32,0:00:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但這到底是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.11,0:01:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那些風車
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.41,0:01:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}並不是在胡亂轉動
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.69,0:01:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}而是被統率著刻意擾亂我的計算式
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.37,0:01:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}她看到的畫面
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.22,0:01:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}透過網路...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.26,0:01:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}幹掉妳!!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.76,0:01:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不會讓你得逞
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.85,0:03:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真是難以理解啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.30,0:03:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}倒在那邊的下三濫
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.01,0:03:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還有妳
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.37,0:03:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}幹嘛要庇護人偶?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.91,0:03:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那些傢伙是妳的劣質複製品
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.23,0:03:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}世界上最看她們不爽的人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.59,0:03:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}應該是妳才對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.96,0:03:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}看到這些跟妳長得一樣的東西被打壞  讓妳感到不爽嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.32,0:03:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}只是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.49,0:03:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這種理由不至於讓妳拚上性命吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.06,0:04:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還是說無法容忍自己以外的絕對能力者搶先誕生嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.06,0:04:07.18,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(1142,980)}Level 6
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.83,0:04:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}又或者是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.50,0:04:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}為這個埋下實驗起因的自己
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.81,0:04:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}來贖罪的嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.59,0:04:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我對什麼「神之頭腦」沒有興趣
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.35,0:04:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}也不認為做這種事就能贖罪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.51,0:04:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}因為她們是妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.04,0:04:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}她們
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.86,0:04:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是我的妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.31,0:04:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}僅此而已
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.31,0:04:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.59,0:04:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}事到如今 我也知道我沒資格這樣說
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.79,0:04:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.95,0:04:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}至少現在容許我...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.20,0:04:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}站在這裡好嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.50,0:04:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.31,0:05:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我絕對不會再讓任何一個人死掉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.91,0:05:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}什麼嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.13,0:05:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我還想說妳會講出什麼狗屁來
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.61,0:05:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}玩姐妹家家酒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.23,0:05:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}無聊到爆
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.13,0:05:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不會再讓任何一個人被殺掉?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.35,0:05:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不要太得意忘形了 妳這個廢渣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.30,0:05:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就憑妳連阻擋我都做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.43,0:05:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就跟視力檢查最多只能量到2.0一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.86,0:05:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還不是因為學園都市
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.15,0:05:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}最多只到等級5而已
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.10,0:05:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我才只好屈於此位
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.13,0:05:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}既然這麼麻煩 乾脆就一起把妳們幹掉...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.41,0:06:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}怎麼可能...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.35,0:06:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你以為...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.71,0:06:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我到目前為止殺過多少人啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.64,0:06:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}怎麼做可以破壞掉人體
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.37,0:06:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我最清楚不過了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.97,0:06:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}都變成那樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.47,0:06:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}怎麼可能...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.70,0:06:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還站得起來!?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.27,0:06:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我在怕什麼!?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.84,0:06:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不就是還沒死成嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.61,0:06:48.29,Default,???,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就算風被封鎖了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.74,0:06:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}光只要碰到他指尖
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.63,0:06:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就足以讓他死掉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.75,0:06:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你還真有趣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.18,0:06:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這真的是...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.79,0:07:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}太有意思啦!!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.52,0:07:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}給我咬緊牙關吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.15,0:07:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}最強的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.74,0:07:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}讓我這個最弱的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.59,0:07:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}稍微發點威吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.14,0:07:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}怎麼會...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.23,0:07:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}怎麼會打不死他?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.52,0:07:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}他想保護...人偶們?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.99,0:07:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還差一步...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.91,0:07:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這份絕對的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.26,0:07:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}為什麼...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.49,0:07:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我會...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.73,0:08:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這份力量 也許有一天...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.10,0:08:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}會和世界為敵
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.80,0:08:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}也有可能會毀滅一切
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.38,0:08:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}可是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.94,0:08:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}只要你進化到「最強」
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.92,0:08:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}也許會有所改變
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.18,0:08:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}為此
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.02,0:08:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}要按照計畫進行實驗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.27,0:08:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}天竺鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.94,0:08:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}人偶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.54,0:08:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}複製人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.50,0:08:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如果力量會引起紛爭
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.45,0:08:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}只要成為讓人連對戰的念頭都不敢起的絕對存在就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.14,0:08:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這樣的話...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.65,0:08:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}總有一天 再也...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.74,0:08:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這樣的話
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.78,0:08:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就再也...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.41,0:09:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就再也...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.78,0:09:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不會傷害任何人...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.70,0:09:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妹妹們可是...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.70,0:09:11.94,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(870,980)}Sisters
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.42,0:09:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}用盡全力地...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.36,0:09:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這些孩子們 是我的...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.04,0:09:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真是的...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.25,0:09:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我到底在幹嘛...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.63,0:10:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.48,0:10:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳怎麼...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.61,0:10:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}打擾囉...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.05,0:10:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}在睡覺啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.33,0:10:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還真的打倒了學園都市的第一位
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.24,0:10:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你還真是亂來啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.05,0:11:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.90,0:11:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}吵到你了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.74,0:11:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這是探病的餅乾
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.29,0:11:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我從百貨地下街挑了比較貴的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.71,0:11:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}應該不錯吃啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.44,0:11:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.96,0:11:22.27,Default,???,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}覺得還是得和你說聲...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.71,0:11:23.55,Default,???,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那個...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.94,0:11:24.95,Default,???,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}很感謝...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.43,0:11:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}說到餅乾的話
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.90,0:11:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還是親手做的最好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.49,0:11:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你啊 到底期待我是什麼樣的角色啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.81,0:11:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒有啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.84,0:11:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}笨拙的人笨拙地費盡心思做出慘不忍睹的餅乾才棒
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.29,0:11:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳不懂嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.04,0:11:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}所以說 你到底是在期待些什麼啊!?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.97,0:11:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}等...等等啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.89,0:11:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這裡是醫院
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.61,0:11:51.49,Default,???,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我是傷患啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.50,0:11:52.28,Default,???,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}啊 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.29,0:11:53.92,Default,???,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這裡有很多精密儀器啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.99,0:11:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.40,0:12:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}昨天晚上
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.22,0:12:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}御坂妹有來過喔
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.08,0:12:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}她說
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.61,0:12:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}實驗已經中止了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.47,0:12:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}可是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.12,0:12:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}都是因為我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.71,0:12:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}讓很多人...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.03,0:12:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如果妳沒有提供DNA圖譜的話
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.29,0:12:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妹妹們也不會出生在這個世界上
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.29,0:12:31.57,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(624,980)}Sisters
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.93,0:12:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}雖然那個實驗也有很多不對的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.36,0:12:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但就妹妹們的出生這件事來看
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.36,0:12:38.14,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(777,980)}Sisters
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.34,0:12:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我覺得
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.77,0:12:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是值得妳驕傲的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.12,0:12:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如果她們沒出生的話
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.06,0:12:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就無法感受快樂
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.80,0:12:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}也無法體會悲傷了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.01,0:12:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}而且她們一定
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.97,0:13:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}也不想看到妳一個人愁眉苦臉的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.42,0:13:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳的傷勢還好嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.81,0:13:09.88,Upside,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}要玩什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.92,0:13:11.27,Upside,???,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}盪鞦韆~~
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.72,0:13:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}和那個少年比起來的話
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.46,0:13:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}根本沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.76,0:13:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.15,0:13:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}要推囉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.92,0:13:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}來
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.20,0:13:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}由機械所創造的生命
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.76,0:13:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}剛出生的她們
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.97,0:13:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是一張白紙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.01,0:13:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}所以
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.97,0:13:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}只要灌輸她們自己是「實驗動物」的話
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.62,0:13:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}她們就會欣然接受這是自己存在的價值
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.21,0:13:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.30,0:13:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如果像他一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.51,0:13:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}周遭的人也將她們當做是人來看待
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.09,0:13:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這些孩子們
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.35,0:13:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}一定也...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.92,0:13:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那個啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.91,0:13:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}也許妳根本不想看到我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.76,0:14:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}也不肯原諒我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.15,0:14:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}今後 妳們要得到世界的接納
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.75,0:14:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}也許還會有許多障礙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.57,0:14:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}所以...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.73,0:14:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這個...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.47,0:14:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}如果有什麼我可以幫忙...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.05,0:14:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}...的話
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.31,0:14:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這就是站立盪鞦韆
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.17,0:14:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}御坂實踐從學習裝置得到的知識與風融為一體
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.17,0:14:24.20,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}{\pos(778,980)}Testament
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.37,0:14:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}哇~~好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.71,0:14:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}再這樣下去可能會影響到傷勢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.50,0:14:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}先告一段落了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.27,0:14:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}御坂擦著汗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.99,0:14:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}哎呀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.90,0:14:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}怎麼了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.18,0:14:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}抱歉 先不要理我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.15,0:14:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.20,0:14:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}再幫我推
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.33,0:14:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}欸~我才不要
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.96,0:14:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這樣不可以唷
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.16,0:14:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}身為姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.49,0:14:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}有義務聽從妹妹的任性
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.29,0:15:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}御坂趁幼苗時期加以洗腦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.15,0:15:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}喂!!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.09,0:15:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這個叫做小貓唷
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.51,0:15:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我知道!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.53,0:15:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}大姐姐 妳們是姐妹嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.83,0:15:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}長得一模一樣!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.88,0:15:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳們是雙胞胎吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.89,0:15:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}哪一個是姐姐? 哪一個是妹妹?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.52,0:15:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這個的話...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.19,0:15:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}等一下 琉璃想猜猜看
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.29,0:15:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我想想喔
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.12,0:15:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我想想...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.05,0:15:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}明明是自己要猜的...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.05,0:15:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這個
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.34,0:15:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這個大姐姐是妹妹對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.65,0:15:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}因為她有呱太
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.73,0:15:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}琉璃也有布偶喔!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.06,0:15:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}御坂做出噴飯的動作
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.23,0:15:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}的確她是有與年齡不符的幼稚喜好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.56,0:15:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}又粗魯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.53,0:15:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}又急性子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.44,0:15:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}又愛吵架
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.68,0:16:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不只這樣 還不敢承認自己喜歡什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.57,0:16:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}非常彆扭
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.68,0:16:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}卻是個會為了御坂而拼上性命
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.74,0:16:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}讓人頭痛的姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.79,0:16:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真是不可思議
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.53,0:16:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}本來御坂應該是要在昨天晚上的實驗死掉的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.93,0:16:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這個是已經重複一萬次以上
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.43,0:16:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}理所當然的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.61,0:16:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}可是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.32,0:16:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}在這個瞬間
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.46,0:16:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}卻仍然繼續在活動
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.85,0:16:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}御坂們
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.24,0:16:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是為了被殺掉才製造出來的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.99,0:16:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這是唯一的存在意義
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.65,0:16:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}也是出生的理由
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.90,0:16:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}可是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.11,0:16:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}因為姐姐與那名少年
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.36,0:16:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}失去了這個存在的目的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.62,0:17:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}被裁員了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.49,0:17:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒工作
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.90,0:17:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}流離失所中
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.84,0:17:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}所以
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.05,0:17:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}為了讓御坂也能找到活著的意義
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.18,0:17:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}今後也請陪著御坂一起去尋找
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.83,0:17:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}御坂竭盡全力任性地說著
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.69,0:17:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}請多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.33,0:17:39.45,Upside,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}姐姐 再一次
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.81,0:17:40.37,Upside,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不夠~
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.89,0:17:41.17,Upside,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}耶~
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.25,0:17:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.86,0:17:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是這麼回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.86,0:17:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒錯沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.13,0:17:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}御坂啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.24,0:17:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}說是在宿舍的廚房
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.61,0:17:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}會引來眾多視線很麻煩
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.74,0:18:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就跑來借我家的烤箱
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.93,0:18:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真是大混亂啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.92,0:18:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}所以才這麼...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.83,0:18:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真是讓人感到意外啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.36,0:18:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.61,0:18:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不過
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.73,0:18:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}御坂似乎恢復了精神  太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.53,0:18:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.73,0:18:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不過 到底是要做給誰當禮物呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.88,0:18:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不管我怎麼問她都不告訴我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.40,0:18:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.89,0:18:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}佐天就只知道拿我開玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.81,0:18:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}又不是因為我喜歡他才做的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.97,0:18:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}只是謝禮啦 謝禮!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.59,0:18:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.42,0:18:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}反正他肯定會說
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.06,0:18:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}「我是為自己而戰 沒做什麼需要被感謝的事情啦」
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.04,0:18:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}諸如此類的話吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.90,0:18:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是我雞婆...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.88,0:18:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}嗎...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.71,0:18:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不不不不
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.00,0:18:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不過 照這個邏輯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.34,0:18:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}要遵照常理和他道謝也是我的自由
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.11,0:18:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}話說回來
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.01,0:19:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}要是敢不收我親手做的餅乾就給我等著瞧...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.03,0:19:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳說什麼東西免費啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.32,0:19:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}為什麼你會在這裡!?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.28,0:19:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你應該還在住院吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.82,0:19:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}沒啦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.99,0:19:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}住院費也不便宜
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.45,0:19:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}而且家裡有個飢餓的同居人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.41,0:19:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}一天比一天更兇暴啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.56,0:19:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}話說
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.42,0:19:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳才是 在這裡做什麼啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.16,0:19:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我是...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.81,0:19:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}莫非 是要再來探望我嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.83,0:19:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}開玩笑啦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.00,0:19:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}才...才不是咧!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.90,0:19:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}也不用...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.27,0:19:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這麼用力的否定啦...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.16,0:19:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}笨蛋!!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.11,0:19:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}啊...不是...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.75,0:19:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我不是來探病的...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.24,0:19:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那...那個...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.43,0:19:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這次是...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.29,0:19:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}受到了你很多幫助...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.38,0:19:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}所以...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.66,0:19:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那個...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.67,0:19:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}謝...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.21,0:19:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}謝...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.37,0:20:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}謝謝...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.40,0:20:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}謝謝...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.53,0:20:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}螞蟻?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.11,0:20:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}你正在進行自由研究啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.53,0:20:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}暑假也要結束了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.36,0:20:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不是啦!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.43,0:20:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}話說你當我是小學生嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.57,0:20:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真抱歉打擾妳了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.22,0:20:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}再見啦 嗶哩嗶哩
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.94,0:20:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}御坂美琴
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.74,0:20:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}是?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.08,0:20:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.07,0:20:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}不是嗶哩嗶哩 是御坂美琴
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.58,0:20:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}每次都這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.52,0:20:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}好歹給我記住
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.74,0:20:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}雖然和你這樣說可能也沒用
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.49,0:20:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}再會啦 御坂
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.14,0:21:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}糟糕啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.87,0:21:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}姐姐大...妳怎麼了!?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.37,0:21:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}身體不舒服嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.92,0:21:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}哪裡受傷了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.20,0:21:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}還是吃了什麼怪東西!?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.53,0:21:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}妳...妳在說什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.87,0:21:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}話說 什麼事情糟糕了?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.76,0:21:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}那是...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.85,0:21:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}前段時間的擅自外宿被舍監知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.42,0:21:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}叫我們要給她一個讓人心服口服的理由...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.73,0:21:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}這下糟糕了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.26,0:21:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}得想個藉口...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.02,0:21:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}話說 妳特地為了告訴我這件事跑來嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.74,0:21:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.20,0:21:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但是 為什麼知道我在這?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.10,0:21:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}心靈相通嘛...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.48,0:21:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}有姐姐大人的地方就有黑子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.30,0:21:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}比起這個 真的沒有地方不舒服嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.35,0:21:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}姐姐大人如果發生了什麼事...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.31,0:21:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我黑子沒辦法坐視不管...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.29,0:21:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.65,0:21:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}再繼續胡說八道
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.92,0:21:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}我就不管妳了喔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.14,0:21:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}因為姐姐大人妳...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.59,0:22:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}露出了我從未見過的表情嘛...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.09,0:23:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}御坂恢復精神真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.45,0:23:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}但是那個餅乾到底是要給誰的?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.27,0:23:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}裸體...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.92,0:23:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}白井?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.60,0:23:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,fx,{\be5\blur5}在讀書會上 讓身心都赤‧裸‧裸~!!!
